                    {
                        "form_id": "ca2f70ff-942e-4f1b-971e-50a734506d6a",
                        "entry_id": "ed507786-18ef-3cef-ad32-7bc53153b333",
                        "tags": [
                            "dative",
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "der Geistesgegenwart"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "479c7b2c-80c3-4bbc-a4a4-b13bfaca1fde",
                        "entry_id": "ed507786-18ef-3cef-ad32-7bc53153b333",
                        "tags": [
                            "accusative",
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "die Geistesgegenwart"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f4ae9055-8ffa-33c0-9b64-e682f38cc4d8",
                        "entry_id": "ed507786-18ef-3cef-ad32-7bc53153b333",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fähigkeit zu einer zügigen, angemessenen Reaktion in einer bestimmten Situation"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7eda79ed-ccbd-442b-8202-45920dc15ffc",
                                "sense_id": "f4ae9055-8ffa-33c0-9b64-e682f38cc4d8",
                                "text": "„Die Prinzessin machte ihm wegen seiner Geistesgegenwart und Umsicht Komplimente, während er loslief, um sein Buch zu holen und es Narcisse zu geben.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d3b9471-5643-4c18-ba23-b4b3e7b7a7e4",
                                "sense_id": "f4ae9055-8ffa-33c0-9b64-e682f38cc4d8",
                                "text": "„Eine Weile schluchzte er, besaß aber die Geistesgegenwart, den halbfertigen Brief nicht mit Tränen zu ruinieren.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4debeb01-9b99-4c6d-9c52-f89927cb317b",
                                "sense_id": "f4ae9055-8ffa-33c0-9b64-e682f38cc4d8",
                                "text": "„Als ich sah, in welchem Zustand ich war, bewunderte ich die Geistesgegenwart meiner Geliebten.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a43aefd-81cc-4987-aaec-749069166500",
                                "sense_id": "f4ae9055-8ffa-33c0-9b64-e682f38cc4d8",
                                "text": "„Doch Nehru hatte gut daran getan, Mountbatten in Indien zu behalten, denn dessen Geistesgegenwart und Kriegserfahrung waren in den Krisen, die die noch unerfahrene indische Regierung nun zu meistern hatte, sehr wertvoll.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8a18d509-37c2-4e23-bb80-6f72de98e355",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed507786-18ef-3cef-ad32-7bc53153b333",
                        "source_sense_id": "f4ae9055-8ffa-33c0-9b64-e682f38cc4d8",
                        "source_sense_description": "Fähigkeit zu einer zügigen, angemessenen Reaktion in einer bestimmten Situation",
                        "target_lang_word": "presence of mind",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "presence of mind",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1418a7ee-5226-3628-b2b0-8e91002bdc84",
                                        "entry_id": "8d3bd043-9af4-30fb-8a86-ffe650c0827c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Focused alertness, good sense, quick-thinking resourcefulness, or stability of feeling and thought, especially in spite of circumstances which are distracting, stressful, or otherwise challenging."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc8c7e58-0a83-452c-af1e-6e1c9c2abb3d",
                                                "sense_id": "1418a7ee-5226-3628-b2b0-8e91002bdc84",
                                                "text": "During the whole agitating scene, Lillie kept up her presence of mind, and was perfectly aware of what she was about; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bee752fd-0097-42c1-a61b-6f5f3530cf2f",
                                                "sense_id": "1418a7ee-5226-3628-b2b0-8e91002bdc84",
                                                "text": "[A]s you are to hear the moſt unexpected and ſurprizing thing that perhaps ever befel any Family in the VVorld, I beg you to promiſe me you vvill receive it vvith Compoſure and a Preſence of Mind ſuitable to a Man of Senſe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "581b0bc6-8bc5-4f82-ab8d-82f9c2438b64",
                                                "sense_id": "1418a7ee-5226-3628-b2b0-8e91002bdc84",
                                                "text": "[T]his magnificent palace would have infallibly been burnt down to the ground, if, by a presence of mind unusual to me, I had not suddenly thought of an expedient."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e9e1daf-925e-460a-99f5-f66a8ae17a80",
                                                "sense_id": "1418a7ee-5226-3628-b2b0-8e91002bdc84",
                                                "text": "[S]he snatched a pistol from the wall, on which some fire-arms hung, and while she screamed to her father to awake, had the presence of mind to present it at the intruder."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d91d3959-8e14-4bca-9ba9-f96c6d409056",
                                                "sense_id": "1418a7ee-5226-3628-b2b0-8e91002bdc84",
                                                "text": "The Major and Captain Costigan were old soldiers and accustomed to face the enemy, so we may presume that they retained their presence of mind perfectly; but the rest of the party assembled in Cos's sitting-room were, perhaps, a little flurried at Pendennis's apparition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8440f4f3-2579-46be-803d-0747f946d830",
                                                "sense_id": "1418a7ee-5226-3628-b2b0-8e91002bdc84",
                                                "text": "It speaks well for Barrett's presence of mind that he had grasped the situation and decided on his line of action before Welch went, and the Head turned his attention to him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c994b27-9a61-4c82-af45-c809792ce54e",
                                                "sense_id": "1418a7ee-5226-3628-b2b0-8e91002bdc84",
                                                "text": "Somebody had the presence of mind to give [Christopher] Reeve mouth-to-mouth resuscitation, and the paramedics arrived about a minute later."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "006a056b-c79a-4658-9074-683b5c26decd",
                                                "sense_id": "1418a7ee-5226-3628-b2b0-8e91002bdc84",
                                                "text": "He slipped and fell under the wagon's wheels, losing his left leg. His presence of mind was quite amazing. The report notes that Webb's knowledge of first aid probably saved his life, and he was able to instruct others who came to help him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "05ce8256-9955-449a-b537-b5280e9cd028",
